---
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout description="Olabode Anise leads data science teams and writes about security, data, and technology.">
  <PageHero title="I lead data science teams that make AI and infrastructure work more understandable, measurable, and useful." />

  <section class="site-container pb-20">
    <div class="grid gap-7 text-base text-[var(--color-primary-muted)]">
      <p>
        <strong class="font-normal text-[var(--color-primary)]">Hi, I’m Olabode Anise.</strong><br />
        I am a Data Science Leader at Figma, where I lead teams across AI, infrastructure, applied research, and data platform work.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong class="font-normal text-[var(--color-primary)]">I care about work that makes technology more accessible and accountable.</strong><br />
        My work sits at the intersection of strategy, measurement, product judgment, and systems thinking. I like helping teams ask sharper questions and build the data foundations needed to answer them well.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong class="font-normal text-[var(--color-primary)]">Before Figma, I worked on security and data systems.</strong><br />
        I was a Software Engineer at Google on Chrome Safe Browsing, focused on protecting people from malware downloads. Before that, I was a Data Scientist at Duo Security, where I worked on data ingestion, machine learning infrastructure, and security behavior analysis.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong class="font-normal text-[var(--color-primary)]">Outside of work, I spend time reading, traveling, and watching sports.</strong><br />
        The Steelers, Auburn Tigers, and Phoenix Suns have all taken years off my life.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
